==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[mucous]] [[membrane]]}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} A membrane which secretes [[mucus]]. It forms the lining of various body passages that communicate with the air, such as the [[respiratory]], [[genitourinary]], and [[alimentary]] tracts including the mouth, nasal passages, [[vagina]] and [[urethra]].

====Synonyms====
* [[mucosa]]

====Related terms====
* [[serous membrane]]

